  "prefLabel": "Ed 1305.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 1305.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to implement the statutory provisions relating to the formula for determining the tuition and transportation costs for approved career and technical education programs and alternative education programs and the procedures for disbursement of funds.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Ed 1300) #12573, eff 7-14-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ed1300.html"
